            <div xml:id="m-ae99d6a5-8664-44cf-aa7b-20fbc3990041">
              <lg xml:id="m-7a0d460f-d97a-443f-b5b5-7f2dbfc00a28">
                <l xml:id="m-bccb12ec-5307-4822-ab32-b25618cdfab5" facs="#m-ae4316d0-962b-428a-8065-a040398ac24b" label="ambiguous">Ash Wednesday.</l><l xml:id="m-998ffa44-ccdb-4585-9107-ff8f91b73319" facs="#m-040e8262-3ccb-41b6-aa47-1f6472f72e20" label="ambiguous">521</l><l xml:id="m-5a9b9cb1-e446-43ec-a15e-390653ba5409" facs="#m-534f961a-bd77-47bf-9ec1-b373cffdbfc1" label="lyrics-like">9. Tu véro, Déus, dedúces éos,</l><l xml:id="m-e5f0ec9a-f615-4a26-beb7-7f036072c976" facs="#m-725e614b-a479-45e8-b861-220c5e296200" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Pátri, et Filio, “et</l><l xml:id="m-6b8da274-510d-41ac-b6b6-f3a3645594d5" facs="#m-975c0808-eb45-4e19-8e2f-7fe2ee1d7b39" label="lyrics-like">in púteum intéritus.</l><l xml:id="m-5c1fe39e-2a92-4786-94fc-ca8c329e3751" facs="#m-3efe07a2-4c7e-4d64-80f3-5416f275a71d" label="lyrics-like">Spiritui sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-5cd2511c-1c87-4ba8-8a1c-6740746f1b85" facs="#m-7aaab718-ab9b-4654-b567-60f1b2bb39df" label="lyrics-like">10. Viri sánguinum et dolósi</l><l xml:id="m-82413af3-050a-44a3-9f97-0b7c182e7557" facs="#m-2d79e5cc-cbe0-4144-b014-76cf3c0b25b7" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in principio, et</l><l xml:id="m-fd491055-904c-4cfc-a00d-d3a1aee79a0e" facs="#m-ab6c7a80-880b-4e55-aea5-0c0ce6e23917" label="lyrics-like">non dimidiábunt dies súos:“égo</l><l xml:id="m-baa84944-990a-4386-8930-02396150c3e1" facs="#m-cd4ccdf8-eb27-414f-b56f-0516c7555d67" label="lyrics-like">nunc, et sémper," et in saécula</l><l xml:id="m-7c6378de-894d-4c80-9216-cb1ef919b31a" facs="#m-510f0eb2-ebba-4dff-b899-6d521b44d14e" label="lyrics-like">autem sperâbo in te, Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-5a99ad0b-fba7-4e89-adfb-43908e0ad607" facs="#m-23bfa98c-0a8c-4f74-b698-010eab141add" label="lyrics-like">saecutórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-acd3f304-d19b-434a-a273-b2303e297b4a" facs="#m-51391669-681e-44f0-aab3-c801007c252c" label="ambiguous">An¬</l><l xml:id="m-a4a84bea-d3ea-4c82-b2f6-fbd3005bc4dc" facs="#m-05071044-0b5b-413b-8850-1b256452b09b" label="ambiguous">tiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-02323979-7296-4b3f-a273-e0a7542cd84e" facs="#m-38547593-2a2f-4ecf-a553-92b0dc72be7d" label="lyrics-like">Dé-us ádjuvat me,</l><l xml:id="m-bbff8147-a28e-493e-a2ee-25e0945c70c1" facs="#m-9e2fddbe-c6ab-42e5-b036-685bbd96700d" label="lyrics-like">et Dóminus suscéptor est áni¬</l><l xml:id="m-b43d2765-af2b-4014-93cd-0056b7f1442c" facs="#m-90afe4ce-2b8f-438c-a328-bacf09b3e425" label="lyrics-like">mae mé-ae.</l><l xml:id="m-25dc8ea1-8034-45bd-a025-666a5e9b4602" facs="#m-65c542fa-28c5-48d9-a59d-f1e402649524" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-95aa09b9-f834-4ef8-92e2-0b731ea06cdd" facs="#m-a364a5e5-a0e9-4b9a-bddb-022c2b6da080" label="ambiguous">Jer. 17. 14.</l><l xml:id="m-a0059874-81c9-42db-9150-a02affd1523e" facs="#m-f9112ab1-353b-4ec6-9cd9-dbe9bd10b0ac" label="lyrics-like">VAna me, Dómine, et sanábor:</l><l xml:id="m-2b963702-abd7-4c0e-8b13-147571c43287" facs="#m-d225714d-ce84-409f-afd8-99219e643052" label="lyrics-like">quóniam laus mea tu es.</l><l xml:id="m-a89c05d0-4174-484b-a71e-7302e4d3353f" facs="#m-9437d1bf-1761-449c-b3b7-6ea62d41eef2" label="ambiguous">O salvum me fac, et salvus ero:</l><l xml:id="m-f23d0a45-eff5-4c39-87d7-a1822a37e6ce" facs="#m-2a31380a-270d-4bc3-af00-9aecf61b0909" label="ambiguous">short!</l><l xml:id="m-734f83a2-14be-47b4-8f3b-56d8994d1638" facs="#m-8656927f-563f-4a88-8638-f3b1078c303a" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-e62e2d0d-dd2b-4e21-b158-a814ae032821" facs="#m-cc69d53a-23cd-4a1f-a410-cdd437fec801" label="lyrics-like">Ana áni-mam mé-am, “ Qui-a peccá-vi tí-bi.</l><l xml:id="m-be8d0133-3c0a-4fd3-9ca8-3a9307a5bc32" facs="#m-f5bab32b-fb9f-4d36-8f91-73138faeec92" label="lyrics-like">V. Ego dixi: Dómine, mi-se-ré-re mé-i. Gló-ri-a Pátri,</l><l xml:id="m-fef82e5b-226c-4826-8793-ba05b81887b7" facs="#m-0adfb801-ff18-4ff6-95b1-f445469ccd7c" label="lyrics-like">et Fí-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-0431a895-1adf-4179-9478-563776de996b" facs="#m-a9576182-d438-4e67-a73a-f5414a18fe28" label="lyrics-like">V. Adiútor méus ésto, ne derelínquas me.</l><l xml:id="m-c66531bd-cbb2-4499-85cc-6f52a059155a" facs="#m-109e28bd-2196-4a78-9e3a-e72c385b458b" label="lyrics-like">R. Neque despicias me, Déus salutáris méus.</l><l xml:id="m-44ff3865-2abf-4198-a8b1-181bf8d84623" facs="#m-c12202f5-3ea5-40ea-81d2-f4d87cec3ff2" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. R. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-bf019434-fb79-4c4a-b2d2-09e66c94873b" facs="#m-014aaa6b-8712-436c-b491-a58b17aab72f" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Prasta, Dómine. 526.</l><l xml:id="m-a1b652bb-82c2-4853-b4c2-cffb595fed48" facs="#m-8ad059bb-b2f1-450b-b1d7-49f021c82cd0" label="lyrics-like">v. Dóminus vobiscum. R. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-fec15b90-7171-4dec-a7a0-b0211240320e" facs="#m-180ca438-dfaf-4ca2-8dc0-6d8c14aa3e55" label="lyrics-like">V. Benedicámus Dómino. I. Déo grátias. (Chant, 240.)</l><l xml:id="m-16854890-c9a5-4c6d-a4b3-f86584836639" facs="#m-577c0a3d-8a92-4d4d-b574-b9ee715937ea" label="lyrics-like">V. Fidélium ánimae per misericórdiam Déi requiéscant in pâce.</l><l xml:id="m-61faf57d-21c4-45e4-a09a-2377ef6e0bff" facs="#m-3242b876-757f-445f-9a3d-847dc4d298cf" label="ambiguous">N. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-550f17ae-c579-4103-8683-8db5a535416c" facs="#m-37c2db47-552d-4672-94cb-77e6cec17908" label="text-like">At the end of Terce, before Mass, the ashes are blessed by the Celebrant in</l><l xml:id="m-d504c793-ae4e-4f6c-a70f-e4808c6efbd2" facs="#m-64f056bd-c97a-4f22-b1d7-becb252ebe6c" label="text-like">the following manner. The Choir first sings the following Antiphon:</l><l xml:id="m-5361ad88-0f03-44e9-b957-b4642b06315a" facs="#m-17a95812-dbe5-45fd-8975-625bc6037bb5" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-e170acbb-2757-469f-af69-1f22b1e86e17" facs="#m-4966d473-751c-4c73-b9fa-c94c15ef0659" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-b1d4a957-7914-482e-9696-d810e72599bd" facs="#m-355754a1-1400-4288-bafc-2fba9ff412d3" label="lyrics-like">xáudi nos “Dómi- ne.</l><l xml:id="m-ba14e659-ffab-40f5-b7da-639246ab3599" facs="#m-f8ce397c-f709-4805-b86e-2b26b68e4a1a" label="lyrics-like">quóni-am be¬ nígna</l><l xml:id="m-f83a2018-82f0-4111-a7cd-d79e8dd88ee3" facs="#m-44f3facf-6fa7-494f-a76b-7e203320db26" label="ambiguous">M</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
